            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR2b007a-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T03:51:42.654+09:00">Unless there is cruelty of (the likes of) Jié and Zhòu</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T03:52:34.674+09:00">and in addition perfect benevolence like that of Tāng and Wǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T03:53:07.716+09:00">and (unless in addition) people are agreed on this</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T03:53:53.415+09:00">and (in addition) Heaven orders action,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T03:56:24.824+09:00">then the proper hierarchy between rulers and subordinates must be maintained in the proper way, even to the point of sacrificing one's life.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
